<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Ms. O&apos;Keeffe returns four weeks after her second injection, eight weeks after starting treatment. Straight lines look nearly straight again with the left eye, and she can read newspaper headlines and judge color in the studio better than in March. She has had no pain, redness, or loss of vision after either injection. Daily Amsler checks show no change in the right eye. She takes the AREDS2 supplement daily. Her low-vision rehabilitation evaluation took place this month, and the home visit and driving assessment are under way. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Interval change</td><td>Distortion nearly gone in the left eye; color judgment better</td></tr><tr><td>Injection tolerance</td><td>No pain, redness, or vision loss after two injections</td></tr><tr><td>Amsler grid</td><td>Daily checks; right eye unchanged</td></tr><tr><td>Low-vision rehabilitation</td><td>Evaluation done; home visit and driving assessment under way</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

